          "kind": "say",
          "line": "📖 The Eulogy narrates, honestly, always: \"and then they knelt, and the story approved.\" The story leans in. (The Eulogy's attacks +15.) (2 verses remain. Contradict it — do the opposite — or give it a better ending.)"
